<div>
<%= @payment.credit_card.first_name %>, you are now the proud owner of an eGoat!
<br/>
<b class='rainbow'>Yay!</b>
<br/>

It costed to you the mere amount of <%= @payment.amount %> bucks, and, hey
it will bring you <b class='rainbow'>JOY AND HAPPYNESS</b> through your entire life of <b class='rainbow'>AWESOMENESS</b>!
<br/>

<%= image_tag 'rainbow.jpg' %>


