this token: <b class='rainbow' id='token'><%= @payment.remote_payment.token || 'TOKEN NOT FOUND. YAY!' %></b>.
</div>
<div style='font-size: 20%;'>
Beware!! You should not share this token with anyone. If somebody were to steal this from
you, he could claim your money from PayBro.
<br/>

This wouldn't be that bad per se, but we would be forced to refund PayBro and take away you eGoat,
with whom you'll surely formed an inscindible bond, like a kidney.
<br/>

Let us rephrase that: You don't want to lose this token, or you'll lose a kidney.
<br/>

</div>
Your eGoat is probably already waiting in your living room by now, watching tv!
Yay!

<div class='rainbow'>
<p>
Your awesome
</p>
<p>
  eGoat Rainbow Carebear Team
</p>
</div>


<script type="text/javascript">
rainbows =document.getElementsByClassName("rainbow");
for (el_id in rainbows) {
   var myRainbowSpan=new RainbowSpan(rainbows[el_id], 0, 360, 255, 50, 18);
   myRainbowSpan.timer=window.setInterval("myRainbowSpan.moveRainbow()", myRainbowSpan.speed);
}
</script>

